{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nVtxytZcG11793087435.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>筲箕灣爆水管，水務署指，一條18吋鑄鐵喉管損毀，筲箕灣及西灣河近一萬戶受影響，預計凌晨前完成修復。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203021-%E7%AD%B2%E7%AE%95%E7%81%A3%E7%88%86%E6%B0%B4%E7%AE%A1%E6%B0%B4%E5%8B%99%E7%BD%B2%E7%AD%B2%E7%AE%95%E7%81%A3%E5%8F%8A%E8%A5%BF%E7%81%A3%E6%B2%B3%E8%BF%91%E8%90%AC%E6%88%B6%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF%E6%96%99%E5%87%8C%E6%99%A8%E5%89%8D%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E4%BF%AE%E5%BE%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>筲箕灣爆水管｜水務署：筲箕灣及西灣河近萬戶受影響　料凌晨前完成修復</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203031-%E7%AD%B2%E7%AE%95%E7%81%A3%E7%88%86%E6%B0%B4%E7%AE%A1%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E8%B7%AF%E6%94%BF%E7%BD%B2%E5%B0%87%E5%85%A8%E5%8A%9B%E9%85%8D%E5%90%88%E6%B0%B4%E5%8B%99%E7%BD%B2%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%BE%B9%E6%9F%A5%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>筲箕灣爆水管．現場｜路政署：將全力配合水務署維修工作　徹查事故原因</strong></a></p><p></p><p>發展局就紅磡站周邊及海濱一帶用地發展提出修訂建議，會興建「雙子塔」，而住宅項目比例增加至超過六成，有測量師估計能增加項目吸引力。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203024-%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E5%B1%80%E5%80%A1%E7%B4%85%E7%A3%A1%E8%88%88%E5%BB%BA%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A1%94%E5%8F%8A%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E4%BD%8F%E5%AE%85%E9%A0%85%E7%9B%AE%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E6%B8%AC%E9%87%8F%E5%B8%AB%E6%96%99%E6%9C%89%E5%8A%A9%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E5%90%B8%E5%BC%95%E5%8A%9B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>發展局倡紅磡興建「雙子塔」及增加住宅項目比例　測量師料有助增加吸引力</strong></a></p><p></p><p>全球大學校長及領袖高峰會一連兩日在灣仔會展舉行。行政長官李家超指，北部都會區是香港未來發展的關鍵。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203008-%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E6%8C%87%E5%8C%97%E9%83%BD%E5%B1%AC%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5%E6%9D%8E%E6%85%A7%E7%90%BC%E7%A8%B1%E4%BF%83%E9%80%B2%E7%94%A2%E5%AD%B8%E7%A0%94%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>李家超指北都屬香港未來發展關鍵　李慧琼稱促進產學研需要政策支持</strong></a></p><p></p><p>香港航空及兩間連鎖電器公司、百老滙攝影器材及友和香港，懷疑資料外洩，涉及至少1,600名客戶。私隱專員公署展開調查。有專家懷疑三間公司共用第三方供應商被入侵導致。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203020-%E6%B8%AF%E8%88%AA%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%A9%E9%96%93%E9%80%A3%E9%8E%96%E9%9B%BB%E5%99%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%96%91%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E5%A4%96%E6%B4%A9%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E6%87%B7%E7%96%91%E5%85%B1%E7%94%A8%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%9B%E6%87%89%E5%95%86%E8%A2%AB%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E6%89%80%E8%87%B4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>港航及兩間連鎖電器公司疑資料外洩　專家懷疑共用第三方供應商被入侵所致</strong></a></p><p></p><p>港鐵藍田站月中連續兩日發生事故，列車服務受阻。港鐵向立法會提交初步調查報告。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203006-%E6%B8%AF%E9%90%B5%E8%97%8D%E7%94%B0%E7%AB%99%E6%9C%88%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%A3%E7%BA%8C%E5%85%A9%E6%97%A5%E7%99%BC%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E6%B8%AF%E9%90%B5%E5%90%91%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%83%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%88%9D%E6%AD%A5%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>港鐵藍田站月中連續兩日發生事故　港鐵向立法會提交初步調查報告</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.908318+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":504,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.988248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:27.286222+00:00","content_hash":"f7f61a5cacdc88b3eb7ab5ccbba14f63ed5cf42cd48c2d39379efae187f18c2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.908318+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}